WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.629 --> 00:00:06.580
You can tell mosquitos apart under a microscope

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:08.950
-- but it’s pretty tedious

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:12.460
Or you can just listen to the beat of their wings

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:16.020
Different species make a different sound --

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:19.650
and it’s easy to capture even with a flip phone

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:25.860
Now, mosquito spotters can upload their "songs" to a website

00:00:25.869 --> 00:00:28.779
that will identify and map the humming pests

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:32.680
With an easy way to find different types of mosquitoes --

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:35.280
public health officials will be able to track

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.100
and even prevent disease outbreaks

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:42.700
Or just compose music with a nice buzz to it

